<title>UK: Hokuriku Electric sets $300 mln 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Hokuriku Electric sets $300 mln 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Morgan Stanley and IBJ International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HOKURIKU ELECTRIC POWER CO INC</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    03.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  =	   PAY DATE    03.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.275     REOFFER    99.98     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.25	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
